      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹2.91 (vs ₹3.37 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.91 (down from ₹3.37 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹1.10b (up 5.6% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹67.8m (down 9.2% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 6.1% (down from 7.1% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 37% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 21% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
